PLACEHOLDER — NOT A REAL JAR
This file is a text placeholder. The real gradle-wrapper.jar is a small ~60KB
binary launcher downloaded from Gradle. We do not download it here because the
environment already has gradle 8.5+ installed.

To regenerate the real wrapper jar, run from the android-app/ directory:
    gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.5

Until then, use the system `gradle` command directly:
    gradle assembleDebug
    gradle tasks
